# Canonical LF in the index and in every checkout. With core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows, git otherwise rewrites working-tree line endings and a harmless
# formatting pass shows up as a whole-file diff. dynamic-analysis.md used to
# carry 59 stray CRs before its two-space Markdown hard breaks.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Markdown hard breaks intentionally end with two spaces; do not report them
# as whitespace errors in `git diff --check`.
*.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol

*.jar   binary
*.class binary
*.png   binary
